{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MoonMiners [Demo]</strong> drops you into a tense, cooperative survival experience on a lunar outpost controlled by a ruthless megacorporation. You and your crewmates must work together to gather resources, restore systems, and complete your quota - all while navigating environmental dangers and unpredictable internal threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this demo, you\u2019ll get a glimpse of the game, including:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Base restoration - Bring your lunar base back online to survive the harsh environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Alien threats - Fight off hostile bugs guarding precious ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Resource mining</strong> - Scan and extract valuable fossils to meet corporate quotas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/extras/06059-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Traitor mode</strong> - Beware: one of your teammates might secretly sabotage your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/extras/06056-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Combat variety</strong> - Engage in both close-quarters and ranged encounters.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/extras/06054-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Vehicle use</strong> - Utilize rovers for transportation across the lunar terrain.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/extras/0605-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the full version of the game, you'll experience:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Vastly expanded environments to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 A wider variety of mission objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Oxygen management - stay alert, or risk running out of air</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681840?t=1749654814","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3681840?t=1749654814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/fdf70c197d77245025d511dd0a75c606c2e35e86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749654814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/fdf70c197d77245025d511dd0a75c606c2e35e86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749654814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MoonMiners [Demo]</strong> drops you into a tense, cooperative survival experience on a lunar outpost controlled by a ruthless megacorporation. You and your crewmates must work together to gather resources, restore systems, and complete your quota - all while navigating environmental dangers and unpredictable internal threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this demo, you\u2019ll get a glimpse of the game, including:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Base restoration - Bring your lunar base back online to survive the harsh environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Alien threats - Fight off hostile bugs guarding precious ores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Resource mining</strong> - Scan and extract valuable fossils to meet corporate quotas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/extras/06059-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Traitor mode</strong> - Beware: one of your teammates might secretly sabotage your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/extras/06056-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Combat variety</strong> - Engage in both close-quarters and ranged encounters.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/extras/06054-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 <strong>Vehicle use</strong> - Utilize rovers for transportation across the lunar terrain.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/extras/0605-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1749654814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the full version of the game, you'll experience:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Vastly expanded environments to explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 A wider variety of mission objectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2013 Oxygen management - stay alert, or risk running out of air</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["MIROWIN"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3681820","name":"MoonMiners"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681840/e